  "note": "From the official VS Code keyboard-shortcut reference cards for Windows and macOS. Mouse-only bindings are omitted: Insert cursor (Alt+Click / Option+click) and Column (box) selection by dragging with Shift+Alt / Shift+Option. Alternate bindings printed beside a primary one are omitted in favour of the primary: F1 for Show Command Palette, Ctrl+F4 for Close editor, Ctrl+I / Cmd+I for Trigger suggestion.",
